TI  - The carbon footprint of livestock farms under conventional management and silvopastoral systems in Jalisco, Chiapas, and Campeche (Mexico)
JF  - Frontiers in Sustainable Food Systems
PB  - Frontiers Media
DO  - 10.3389/fsufs.2024.1363994
SN  - 2571-581X
